@startuml payment-state
title Payment — Canonical V1 Lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> INITIATED
INITIATED --> AUTHORIZED : provider authorization
AUTHORIZED --> CONFIRMED : confirmed provider fact
INITIATED --> FAILED
AUTHORIZED --> FAILED
INITIATED --> CANCELLED
AUTHORIZED --> CANCELLED
CONFIRMED --> PARTIALLY_REFUNDED : partial correction
CONFIRMED --> REFUNDED : full refund
PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --> REFUNDED : remaining refund

FAILED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]

note right of CONFIRMED
Payment confirmation is server-authoritative.
An uncertain provider/local outcome opens a separate
PaymentReconciliationCase; it never erases payment history.
end note
@enduml
